{"3826170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Storm Horse Simulator", "steam_appid": 3826170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Answer the Call of the Wild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your spirit as Storm, a wild stallion born from legends. Your journey starts on golden plains, where the spirit of your father, Amadeus, legendary leader and icon of freedom, appears. He reveals that real strength flows from the heart. Guided by his wisdom, you begin your quest for freedom, reconnecting with loyal friends like Maximilianus and showing through your devotion that the island’s wild souls are ready to run together once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/568c4109a3168a1723e156a4a11e7f3c.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/568c4109a3168a1723e156a4a11e7f3c.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/568c4109a3168a1723e156a4a11e7f3c.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Wild Herd</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer the call of the wild and build a herd that becomes your new family. As your sanctuary expands, you welcome up to eight companions beneath your watchful care. Each thunderous gallop across boundless meadows, every berry savored together, and every quest for cool water forges a connection stronger than any barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c5f33ca054adf4323f7bef7d3bdb10a7.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c5f33ca054adf4323f7bef7d3bdb10a7.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c5f33ca054adf4323f7bef7d3bdb10a7.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Remain Untamed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the human world tries to take your freedom, respond with stealth and unwavering courage. When humans threaten your freedom, answer with cunning and fierce resolve. Glide through moonlit settlements to shatter fences and liberate captive kin like Felix. Never yield - if someone dares to mount you, send them flying with a wild buck, showing that only the wind commands your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/5a187976d3fc88a8f81c995f6a88a79f.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/5a187976d3fc88a8f81c995f6a88a79f.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/5a187976d3fc88a8f81c995f6a88a79f.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Bond</strong> <strong>Beyond Boundaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you discover an unlikely companion: Ahuli, a wounded warrior whose spirit matches your own. Together, you help the island’s creatures, from gentle hay gathering with a creaking wagon to battling fierce fires to protect what matters most. This alliance, forged in respect, proves that horse and human can stride together toward hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gallop Toward Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hooves thunder across four breathtaking realms:  from emerald forests and frozen peaks to the scorching sands of the desert. Hone your abilities, brave gathering storms, and ready yourself for the final battle for true freedom. As Storm, you become the island’s living answer to the call for liberty, your spirit echoing to the farthest horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c8e6aee1531a6558f5b48e2f7e067a88.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c8e6aee1531a6558f5b48e2f7e067a88.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h