> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Bond</strong> <strong>Beyond Boundaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you discover an unlikely companion: Ahuli, a wounded warrior whose spirit matches your own. Together, you help the island’s creatures, from gentle hay gathering with a creaking wagon to battling fierce fires to protect what matters most. This alliance, forged in respect, proves that horse and human can stride together toward hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/8adaff7291e508c48d1fb37c7be593ad.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gallop Toward Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hooves thunder across four breathtaking realms:  from emerald forests and frozen peaks to the scorching sands of the desert. Hone your abilities, brave gathering storms, and ready yourself for the final battle for true freedom. As Storm, you become the island’s living answer to the call for liberty, your spirit echoing to the farthest horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c8e6aee1531a6558f5b48e2f7e067a88.poster.avif?t=1786637788\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c8e6aee1531a6558f5b48e2f7e067a88.webm?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/extras/c8e6aee1531a6558f5b48e2f7e067a88.mp4?t=1786637788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run. Discover. Unite.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2>", "short_description": "Run wild and free! Become an untamed stallion in a cozy open-world adventure and set out to rescue your captive family. Outsmart patrols, build a safe haven for your growing herd, and form an unbreakable bond with a native friend. Your homeland awaits - answer the call of the wild!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/e86d052ab0bed6e42ceb490b23e2e734c3725afa/header.jpg?t=1786637788", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/771e764d53fb018800d4860f0506792222df38d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786637788", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826170/771e764d53fb018800d4860f0506792222df38d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786637788", "website": "https://indieforgestudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD Radeon 5600XT (6 GB)<b